x critical bugs that may affect performance or productivity\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/michaelb/do-nothing.vim/pull/7|#7 Fix critical bugs that may affect performance or productivity\u003e","text":"Thanks your great Vim plugin. I installed this Vim plugin without any performance delays. Cool.\n\nI found critical bugs that may affect performance or productivity","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/michaelb/do-nothing.vim|michaelb/do-nothing.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1633963036}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fuita","count":6,"users":["U78A6ESHM","UAZ33BKV2","U02BDFBM620","U9S4G0LJW","U02G79NJMLY","U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0eX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b84aeead-c184-40ea-bfa3-24fc5f3fc423","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"僕も重大なバグ修正送るか。","ts":"1633962941.418800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":2,"users":["U78A6ESHM","U02BDFBM620"]},{"name":"sasumatsu","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U02BDFBM620"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IPbf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b6ad770d-1244-435e-82df-740246be575e","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"PR の本文いいなぁw","ts":"1633962860.418500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"heart","count":1,"users":["U02BDFBM620"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UlB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9b70905-ba9f-47e4-8056-3732c71338fd","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"次は `doc/do-nothing.txt` のコントリビュートですね！(もっと難しいw","ts":"1633962655.417800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"honsore","count":1,"users":["U02BDFBM620"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0FSh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33d4b695-8ba3-4ba5-9bb9-e67e70e1d7d8","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"ちなみに，初期実装だとplugin空ファイルが置いてあったんですが，それだと実行時間が遅くなることが判明して，autoloadに移したらしいです．","ts":"1633962587.417200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fuita","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U02G79NJMLY"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gYnDj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a92a67e1-b425-4621-892b-fa06fef4e82b","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"そしたらレビューに時間がかかりますっていわれました","ts":"1633962131.414500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":4,"users":["U78A6ESHM","U9S4G0LJW","UKHUVMBJR","U02G79NJMLY"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qq0=t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"feda3a9a-3b70-4190-be8c-e34ebd48ee44","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/michaelb/do-nothing.vim/pull/6\u003e","ts":"1633962030.413800","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/michaelb/do-nothing.vim/pull/6|#6 neovim to Neovim\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/michaelb/do-nothing.vim/pull/6|#6 neovim to Neovim\u003e","text":"I am sorry that I found a severe problem with this repository. I would like to help you solve this problem if you would not mind spending an amount of time. The following is the description of this problem.\n\nTo participate in the hacktoberfest, I searched suspicious repositories to contribute to the open-source community.  \nThen, I found this repository. The code is thoroughly tested, and wonderfully organized code. Thus, it looks clean with no bugs.  \nHowever, I believe that the repository is suspicious; it might contain a potential bug. Honestly, this bug hunting is the most complex challenge I have ever tried.\n\nAt first, I studied your code in autoload folder. Amazingly, the code is perfect, and there is no ugly code even you write it in VimL. So I estimate you are a vim specialist.\n\nNext, I read the LICENSE file. I suggest another license like CC0 or the Unlisence because the MIT license requires the copyright notice to use your code in other projects. So the MIT license is too strict license for your project. However, this is not a bug.\n\nFinally, I found a severe issue in README. I first considered telling you privately by e-mail with PGP or other security tools because it causes a significant impact on your project. Still, I have decided to send this pull request to tell you immediately. Please quickly merge it before other Neovim users finding you.\n\nThe issue is a typo.\n\nBest wishes,","fields":[{"title":"Labels","value":"hacktoberfest-accepted","short":true},{"title":"Comments","value":"1","short":true}],"mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/michaelb/do-nothing.vim|michaelb/do-nothing.vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1633949446}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9jI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e84775d4-edce-4272-8d88-52fd4dd9c57a","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","text":"ちょうど先程このリポジトリがHacktoberfestに登録されているのを見つけたので，無理だろと思いつつも，頑張ってプルリクエストだした．今までで一番難しい仕事だった．","ts":"1633961998.413600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U78A6ESHM"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yEq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aec69fd2-3435-488d-9e4e-624b0e1471ed","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"オーバーフローして休みが-1日、とかなったりして","ts":"1633960714.411400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":2,"users":["U782D5DF1","U02G79NJMLY"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rs1/f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e4722a46-055d-42d0-9ea9-7de397b2f90f","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"週休8日.vim インストールしたら休み増えませんか？","ts":"1633960682.411100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_t